Package: fqardl
Type: Package
Title: Fourier ARDL Methods: Quantile, Nonlinear, Multi-Threshold &
        Unit Root Tests
Version: 1.0.4
Date: 2026-08-08
Maintainer: Muhammad Alkhalaf <muhammedalkhalaf@gmail.com>
